        "text": "So what are the different types of lsd? Number one Rebasing tokens with Lido Dao, the biggest LSD provider. When you stake your ETH, you receive staked ETH one to one and every day at 12pm, the amount of staked ETH you hold goes up or rebases. 2. Reward bearing tokens with both Coinbase and Rocketpool. When you stake your eth, you receive a token that increases its underlying value over time, but the amount of tokens you hold doesn't go up. Number three Base token plus reward token with stakewise when you stake your eth, you receive the base token. Every 24 hours you hold the base token, you receive the reward token, which can be exchanged for ETH1 to 1. 4. The FRAX team came up with not one but two solutions to the liquidity problem.",
